5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm Sakura. Let's find the wolf together!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,I am Minako. I will keep our discussion calm and focused on facts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,Victoria here. I observe carefully. Let's establish a baseline for truth.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Takumi! I'm ready to fight. Who do we trust first?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I am Misaki. I prefer to listen before speaking. Let's proceed.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Takumi sounds intense! Maybe too intense? Just kidding, I like your energy.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Intensity is not proof of guilt. We need logical consistency, not just volume.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. Watch for contradictions. Silence can be as loud as shouting.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I don't hide! If I'm the wolf, I'd say so. I'm human!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Claims of innocence are common. We need evidence, not just declarations.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, Misaki is so serious! I like a mystery. Who is the Seer?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,Revealing roles too early is dangerous. Let's see who acts suspiciously first.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"The Seer's information is vital. Protect them, but verify their claims.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I'll protect whoever is the Seer! Just tell me who to watch.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Misaki,,We should watch everyone equally. Bias leads to mistakes. Stay objective.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Okay, okay! I'll be the fun one. You all be the smart ones!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,Balance is key. Let's end the day with clear observations for tomorrow.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"Noted. I will track speech patterns. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Goodnight! I'm not sleeping. I'm watching. See you tomorrow!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Goodnight. Rest well. We have a long game ahead.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
