38,1,2,talk,Victoria,,High energy is not a reliable indicator of humanity. That is weak logic.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Hey! I'm not just energy! I'm a real person! Thanks for checking, Minako!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Misaki,,Victoria has a point. Why Takumi? Was it random or strategic?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Sakura,,Maybe she just likes Takumi! That's why she checked him!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minako,,I do not check based on personal preference. I check to establish truth.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"If you are the Seer, your logic must be sound. Otherwise, you are lying.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not lying! I'm just excited! Minako, trust me, I'm good!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"The pressure is on Minako. If you are the Seer, prove your method.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I think Minako is the Seer! She seems smart. Let's trust her for now!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minako,,I appreciate the trust. I will use it wisely. Let's vote for the wolf.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"Trust is earned, not given. I remain skeptical of Minako's initial choice.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I vote for Victoria! She's too suspicious! She's the wolf!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"Takumi, accusing Victoria without evidence is risky. Let's be careful.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
